  "system": {
    "description": "<p>A calling for one who would sit atop a mountain of riches.</p><p></p><p>For most in this dismal world, wealth and luxury are unattainable dreams. For those willing to relieve others of their hard-earned possessions, however, those dreams lie just beyond a locked door. Why toil endlessly for what could be gained with a single great act of subterfuge? Coin is no more useful burdening the pockets of the wealthy than it is collecting dust in the vaults of the dead. And once those wealthy misers have perished and been tucked away in their tombs, would not their riches be better off in the warmth of your living hands?</p>",
